## 4) Enterprise (enterprise)

`compliance_packs/` format
- YAML pack with rules and example policy mappings.
Example `gdpr.yml`:
```yaml
name: GDPR
description: Detect PII and require redaction
rules:
  - id: pii_presence
    match: ["EMAIL","PERSON_NAME"]
    action: require_redaction
```

`integrations/`
- Provide webhook dispatcher interface (send alerts to Slack/Jira).
- Start with a simple `integrations/webhook.py` that posts JSON to configured URLs.

