## 5) Web Dashboard (web)

Minimal MVP:
- `backend/` can reuse api or add extra report endpoints.
- `frontend/` simple React app: login (api-key), scan form, table of results, filter by severity, download JSON.

Essential pages:
- Dashboard (last 50 scans)
- Scan detail (raw text + findings with highlight)
- Policies editor (create/update YAML)

Use CRA or Vite + React. For speed use plain React + MUI or Tailwind.

