## 7) DevOps & Local Development

docker-compose.yml (dev)
- services: api, proxy, db (postgres for staging), frontend (optional)
- Example minimal compose for local:
```yaml
version: '3.8'
services:
  api:
    build: .
    command: uvicorn api.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload
    volumes: ["./api:/app/api","./engine:/app/engine"]
    ports: ["8000:8000"]
  proxy:
    build: ./proxy
    ports: ["3000:3000"]
  db:
    image: postgres:15
    environment:
      POSTGRES_USER: govern
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: govern
      POSTGRES_DB: govern
    ports: ["5432:5432"]
```

Requirements / dependencies (update requirements.txt)
- fastapi
- uvicorn[standard]
- pydantic
- sqlalchemy
- pyyaml
- presidio-analyzer (optional)
- pytest

Run commands (PowerShell):
```powershell
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn api.main:app --reload
# or with Docker Compose
docker-compose up --build
```

